SUMMARY:CCTA 2027: Full paper submission (23:59 UTC+12 (assumed))
DESCRIPTION:IEEE Conference on Control Technology and Applications (CCTA 20
 27)\n\nFull paper submission: 7 Feb 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n\nConfe
 rence: August 23-25\, 2027\nLocation: Hiroshima\, Japan\nVenue: Internatio
 nal Conference Center Hiroshima\n\nAll dates:\n  Full paper submission: 7 
 Feb 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Notification of acceptance: 15 May 20
 27\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Final paper submission: 23 Jun 2027\, 23:59
  UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Late breaking submission: 30 Jun 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 
 (assumed)\n\nThe call for papers states no timezone. This is counted as UT
 C+12\, the earliest it could plausibly mean\, so the countdown runs out be
 fore the real deadline rather than after it.\n\n11th CCTA. Technical works
 hops on 22 August. Papers are up to 8 pages for review and 6 in the final 
 version. Late-breaking posters need a short abstract and a poster.\n\nCall
  for papers: https://ccta2027.ieeecss.org/\nDetails: https://powersystemde
 adlines.org/conference/ccta27
LOCATION:Hiroshima\, Japan
URL;VALUE=URI:https://ccta2027.ieeecss.org/
